L = 2 m
D = 0.05 m²/s
solve ∂T/∂t = D * ∂²T/∂x²
    with T(x, 0 s) = 300 K + 10 K * cos(π x / L), ∂T/∂x(0 m, t) = 0 K/m, ∂T/∂x(L, t) = 0 K/m
    for x from 0 m to L, t from 0 s to 20 s
    grid 400
print (T(0 m, 20 s) - 300 K) / (10 K) to 12 digits
print ∫ T(x, 20 s) dx from 0 m to L / L in K to 12 digits
